WEBVTT

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.865
ne zvuči suludo,

00:00:30.865 --> 00:00:34.941
već zadovoljavajuće.

00:00:34.941 --> 00:00:37.843
Doživela sam taj trenutak
oko svoje desete godine rada,

00:00:37.843 --> 00:00:40.310
i srećom, tada sam naučila

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:43.974
da ova ideja zapravo postoji,

00:00:43.974 --> 00:00:47.817
i to je možda upravo ono
što sistemu treba.

00:00:47.817 --> 00:00:50.520
Ekonomisti to zovu
nezavisnim prebačajem novca,

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.680
i to je upravo to: novac dat

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.952
bez ikakvih obaveza.

00:00:54.952 --> 00:00:56.516
Vlade u državama u razvoju

00:00:56.516 --> 00:00:58.192
rade ovo decenijama,

00:00:58.192 --> 00:01:00.724
i tek sada, sa više dokaza